# Realm balance (2026-10-26): Midgard had the fewest realm lines (1,375 ambient against 1,545 for Albion and 1,679 for
# Hibernia), so it gets a block of its own here, and Albion a smaller one. Places only from the speaker's realm, always
# with @about place. "[a|b]" parts are expanded by build_corpus.py. New writing.

# ---- Midgard ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
